{
  "title": "NEXUS AI  Tableau de bord opérationnel",
  "uid": "nexus-operational",
  "tags": ["nexus", "operational"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "Prometheus" }
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
        "query": "label_values(up, job)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Statut des containers (cibles scrapées)",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "up", "format": "table", "instant": true, "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "description": "Statut up/down (1/0) de chaque job scrapé par Prometheus  couvre les services applicatifs exposant /metrics (nexus_api, pytorch_models, celery_flower, redis, postgres, cadvisor, node_exporter, vllm), pas les containers sans exporteur propre (ceux-ci apparaissent uniquement via cAdvisor, panel ci-dessous)."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Containers vus par cAdvisor (dernière activité)",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "container_last_seen{name!=\"\"}", "format": "table", "instant": true, "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "CPU global (hôte)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 - (avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "legendFormat": "{{ instance }}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "max": 100 }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "RAM globale (hôte)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes)) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{ instance }}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "max": 100 }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Alertes actives",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}", "format": "table", "instant": true, "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "description": "Métrique interne `ALERTS` générée par le moteur d'évaluation de règles de Prometheus lui-même (pas un exporteur externe)  une série par alerte en état `firing`."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Redémarrages de containers (24h)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "changes(container_start_time_seconds{name!=\"\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "{{ name }}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Voir infrastructure/prometheus/alerts/infrastructure_alerts.yml (ContainerRestarting) pour la justification de `changes()` sur cette jauge cAdvisor plutôt qu'un compteur dédié (absent de cAdvisor)."
    }
  ]
}
